 # tags: site:section
 Text:Site1  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:23Z (SITE66606-1) 'A deleted serial keeps its row. The RFDs above still cite it, and deleting a directory does not delete a citation.
 # tags: site:section-note
